Gtk+ 2.2.x, but this should affect other text-based windows as well. You
might try setting the PANGO_WIN32_NO_UNISCRIBE environment variable to
some non-empty value (which will speed up text rendering at the cost of
non-latin font rendering) and see if it helps.

